	"mem.jardim.title": "Memory — The vote",
	"mem.jardim.text": "“No one was forced. We raised our hands and the sea stopped falling. We thought keeping everything was the same as remembering.”",
	"mem.cidade.title": "Memory — The guardians",
	"mem.cidade.text": "“We built guardians so no one could undo the vote. We gave them a single order: protect the dry. We forgot to tell them why.”",
	"mem.coracao.title": "Memory — The request",
	"mem.coracao.text": "“If a machine ever reaches this place, let it choose better than we did. We don't ask forgiveness. We ask for a second tide.”",
	"echo.farol_ilhota": "“The keeper lit the light for those coming home. After the Fracture no one came — and he kept lighting it.”",
	"echo.farol_topo": "“The Lighthouse's last light pointed at the Heart. They said it was just a habit.”",
	"echo.farol_arquivo": "“In the archive every island had a different map. None of them showed the bottom.”",
	"echo.jardim_flutuante": "“I planted crystals where corals used to be. They grow slowly, but they never forget the shape of water.”",
	"echo.jardim_cisterna": "“The cistern used to keep rainwater. Later it kept the whole rain.”",
	"echo.jardim_ilhota": "“If anyone reads this map: the tide is not the enemy. It only wants to finish what it started.”",
	"echo.jardim_praca": "“The first guardian was made of salt, to remember the sea it watched.”",
	"echo.jardim_mirante": "“From here the wind stopped halfway. Like us.”",
	"echo.cidade_torre": "“We turned the city over so the weight would stay on top. We thought nothing would fall that way.”",
	"echo.cidade_bonde": "“The last tram left empty. The driver said someone had to finish the line.”",
	"echo.cidade_mercado": "“At the market we traded memories for years. Forgetting became expensive.”",
	"echo.cidade_praca": "“The sluice was the first thing we closed. The last thing we tried to open.”",
	"echo.cidade_varanda": "“From the balcony you could see the still ocean. It looked like glass. It looked safe.”",
	"echo.coracao_camara": "“There were two voices in the Heart: one asked to hold on, the other to let go.”",
	"echo.coracao_leito": "“There were still shells on the dry bed. The sea had been there — and wanted to come back.”",
	"echo.coracao_agulha": "“The needle told time by the tide. Since the vote it always shows the same hour.”",
	"echo.coracao_espiral": "“Going down to the Heart was like remembering: every step, a different tide.”",
	"echo.coracao_mirante": "“Look down. That's where we came from. That's where everything wants to go.”",
	"final.question": "The Heart holds the ocean still. Free the natural cycle, or keep the archipelago stable?",
